Sita gives jewel as triple memory and bids Hanuman plan sorrow-ending effort --- Sita sends welfare to Rama Lakshmana Sugriva and all monkeys --- Sita begs Hanuman to move Rama to save her --- Sita asks one day stay then fears death after parting --- Sita doubts monkey bear hosts or princes can cross ocean --- Sita demands glorious rescue by whole forces befitting Rama --- Hanuman promises Sugriva with crores of unhindered leapers will come --- Hanuman promises Rama Lakshmana on his back will kill Ravana and crown reunion
